# REVIEW

<!-- M101 -->
What a review of this project looks for.

## What failure looks like

- {{NEVER_WRONG}}
- A check made to pass without fixing the cause.

## Small points

At most 3 small points (names, wording, style) in a review. Leave out the rest.

## Paths to skip

Files no one writes by hand, such as generated files or copied libraries: none yet.

## Evidence

Each finding names the file and the line, and says what goes wrong there.

## Summary

The summary starts with the counts: how many findings, and how many of them block the merge.
